  <revision rev="7" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>940596dec3fd202fe0246bef645845f7</srcmd5>
    <version>0.11.2</version>
    <time>1791394365</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 0.11.2:
  * Bump version
  * Fix validation warnings creating disjoint vkImages
  * Apply more clippy suggestions
  * Use libavutil's new queue API
  * Bump version
  * Log Vulkan driver version details
  * Block timeline semaphore export with NVIDIA
  * Ensure ash::Device is deleted on error path
  * Fix accidental doctests and invalid link
  * Avoid panic with nonintegral viewport crops
  * Reject oversize wl_shm buffer allocations
  * Avoid panic with wl_buffers not divisible by scale
  * Ensure unknown format fallback damage region is nonempty
  * Check wl_shm_pool::resize does not shrink file
  * Permit zero stride values for wl_shm buffers
  * Reject invalid zero size wl_shm buffers
  * Cleanly error when Wayland objects lack extra data
  * Relax overly strict buffer size check for fuzzing
  * Add simple fuzzer script focused on protocol handling
  * Validate protocol timestamp nanosecond fields
  * Ignore SIGPIPE for connection handlers
  * Deduplicate some signal handling code
  * Extract main loop code into library
  * Automatically set log level for xwayland-satellite
  * Log message on unexpected dmabuf format event
  * Drop OPCODE_ZWP_LINUX_DMABUF_V1_FORMAT events for VulkanSetup case
  * Use glsl 'restrict' in yuv conversion shaders
  * Check that shader compilation succeeded
  * Allow video encoding for more DMABUF formats (forwarded request 1382874 from dirkmueller)</comment>
    <requestid>1382884</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
